# Supabase credentials for accounts + cloud backup.
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Project Settings → API: copy the Project URL and the "anon"/public key.
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` in the mobile/ folder and fill these in.
# 4. Run mobile/supabase/schema.sql in the Supabase SQL editor.
# The anon key is safe to ship in a client app — Row Level Security protects data.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key
